        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 25 at 3:30PM AKDT until September 26 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Offshore Waters Forecast for the Bering Sea

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...W wind 25 to 40 kt. Seas 13 to 20 ft. Rain showers.
.SAT...NW wind 15 to 30 kt. Seas 9 to 17 ft.
.SAT NIGHT...NW wind 15 to 25 kt. Seas 10 ft.
.SUN...NW wind 15 to 25 kt. Seas 6 to 9 ft.
.SUN NIGHT...NW wind 20 kt. Seas 7 ft.
.MON THROUGH TUE...W wind 20 kt. Seas 6 ft.
.WED...E wind 25 kt. Seas 6 to 11 ft.
</description>
